<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 5/6.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 5/6.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May</p>
<p>5/6. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	    May 5/6	    May 2/5</p>
<p> CZK	0.44685	    0.44601</p>
<p> DKK	2.10076	    2.10159</p>
<p> FIM	2.65185	    2.65559</p>
<p> HUF	0.0758	     0.07575</p>
<p> JPY	0.10916	    0.10881</p>
<p> LTL	3.45418	    3.44436</p>
<p> LVL     23.73956	   23.65854</p>
<p> RUR	0.0024	     0.00239</p>
<p> SEK	1.75027	    1.76162</p>
<p> UAH	7.58858	    7.56813</p>
<p> USD     13.8188	    13.774</p>
<p> XEU     15.60488	   15.58597</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
